WEBVTT

01:38.330 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.110 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 29]

02:05.480 --> 02:06.120
Young master.

02:06.120 --> 02:06.920
You're awake.

02:07.230 --> 02:07.890
How are you?

02:08.000 --> 02:09.150
Are you feeling better?

02:09.150 --> 02:10.550
Is there any discomfort?

02:16.960 --> 02:17.690
Your clothes

02:17.870 --> 02:18.590
are inside.

02:18.800 --> 02:20.130
I'll go get them for you.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.980
Young master, please have a seat.

02:31.610 --> 02:32.190
I've tidied up

02:32.190 --> 02:33.470
your clothes for you.

02:33.870 --> 02:35.120
Please rest easy and recover.

02:35.120 --> 02:35.870
Our master

02:35.870 --> 02:37.420
knows a bit about medicine.

02:37.690 --> 02:38.910
You were trapped in a fire.

02:38.910 --> 02:39.750
It was a neighbour from the village

02:39.750 --> 02:41.460
who rescued you and brought you here.

02:41.460 --> 02:43.390
You can stay here and rest assured.

02:48.940 --> 02:49.850
There are more.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.650
There are these too.

02:58.800 --> 03:00.400
Young master, you must be starving.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.840
There's still hot food on the stove.

03:01.840 --> 03:02.800
I'll bring it to you.

03:02.800 --> 03:04.000
Please wait a moment.

03:31.540 --> 03:32.220
Man Ying.

03:41.990 --> 03:42.740
What are you looking at?

03:42.740 --> 03:43.940
You seem so absorbed.

03:44.850 --> 03:46.380
Mr. Bai's farewell letter.

03:47.010 --> 03:48.010
Farewell letter?

03:49.060 --> 03:50.020
He said in a couple of days,

03:50.020 --> 03:51.620
he'll be leaving Guangping.

03:52.280 --> 03:53.310
You've seen him?

03:54.750 --> 03:55.470
I have.

03:56.150 --> 03:57.280
Did you take action?

03:58.630 --> 04:00.120
Am I really just

04:00.530 --> 04:01.810
a cold-blooded,

04:01.840 --> 04:03.500
ruthless killer in your eyes?

04:04.840 --> 04:05.400
No.

04:06.540 --> 04:07.510
Then why is he suddenly leaving

04:07.510 --> 04:08.910
when everything's fine?

04:10.460 --> 04:12.390
Why are you so concerned about him?

04:14.470 --> 04:15.570
I just think

04:16.269 --> 04:17.470
he's not a bad person.

04:17.500 --> 04:18.459
He doesn't deserve

04:18.459 --> 04:19.459
a miserable fate.

04:22.900 --> 04:24.630
You've only met him a few times,

04:24.920 --> 04:26.680
and you already think he's not bad?

04:26.680 --> 04:28.140
He's not bad to begin with.

04:31.300 --> 04:31.980
Yesterday,

04:32.330 --> 04:33.590
I went to Fa'en Temple.

04:37.040 --> 04:38.040
So you're saying

04:38.070 --> 04:39.450
there are two Mr. Bai?

04:40.010 --> 04:41.890
One is the snake demon Chilian,

04:41.920 --> 04:43.380
and the other is Xingxian?

04:44.190 --> 04:44.990
That's right.

04:45.720 --> 04:46.530
No wonder

04:46.920 --> 04:47.870
sometimes I felt

04:47.870 --> 04:49.130
he was very close to me.

04:50.720 --> 04:52.540
The one you're familiar with

04:52.720 --> 04:53.850
should be Xingxian.

04:54.600 --> 04:55.860
Surprising, isn't it?

04:57.360 --> 04:58.820
I didn't expect it either.

04:59.450 --> 05:01.340
A snake demon who had never done evil

05:01.340 --> 05:02.140
actually killed two people

05:02.140 --> 05:03.250
for her sake,

05:03.570 --> 05:04.320
and even used the snake slough

05:04.320 --> 05:06.180
to help her change her appearance

05:06.220 --> 05:08.620
to evade the authorities' investigation.

05:09.710 --> 05:12.040
This snake demon treats Xingxian so well.

05:18.240 --> 05:20.640
No matter how well, killing is still wrong.

05:20.750 --> 05:22.760
I'm not trying to make things difficult for him.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.620
It's just that demons live longer

05:24.870 --> 05:25.950
and are more powerful.

05:25.950 --> 05:28.000
Ordinary people can compare to them.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.350
If they want to kill,

05:30.290 --> 05:31.120
a mortal's life hangs

05:31.120 --> 05:32.630
on their whim.

05:33.260 --> 05:34.950
So it's hard for them to see human life

05:34.950 --> 05:36.430
as something precious.

05:37.950 --> 05:38.920
Since he had a reason

05:38.920 --> 05:40.320
to kill the first person,

05:40.720 --> 05:42.310
it's very likely that, in the future,

05:42.310 --> 05:43.560
he uses the same reason

05:43.560 --> 05:44.890
to kill a second person,

05:45.000 --> 05:45.730
even a third.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.880
So we absolutely cannot let it be

05:48.180 --> 05:49.900
and allow him to act as he pleases.

05:49.900 --> 05:51.550
No one is born a sage,

05:52.040 --> 05:52.970
and no one

05:53.060 --> 05:55.030
can always distinguish right from wrong.

05:55.030 --> 05:56.380
Let alone a demon.

05:57.070 --> 05:57.850
Alright, alright.

05:57.850 --> 05:58.940
Hurry up and eat.

06:01.390 --> 06:02.470
You talk too much.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.130
You're even more naggy than my father.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.310
Sir.

06:20.710 --> 06:21.710
Are you going out?

06:27.600 --> 06:29.480
Aren't we leaving in a couple of days?

06:29.480 --> 06:31.540
I thought I'd go viist the neighbours

06:31.720 --> 06:32.680
to bid farewell.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.580
What about you?

06:34.830 --> 06:37.090
Are you going to Liushui Pavilion today?

06:37.310 --> 06:38.000
I have to.

06:38.500 --> 06:40.310
After all, I've known the owner for many years.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.240
Before leaving,

06:41.480 --> 06:43.140
I should at least say goodbye.

06:43.620 --> 06:44.880
Then I'll be going now.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.630
Be careful on your way.

06:46.630 --> 06:47.560
Come back early.

06:54.810 --> 06:59.400
[Puji]

07:17.540 --> 07:20.630
Your faithful devotee, Xingxian, is grateful for the Bodhisattva's blessings,

07:20.630 --> 07:22.720
and have come specially to fulfil my vow.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.220
Although the act of solving my troubles

07:24.220 --> 07:26.680
did not come directly from the Bodhisattva,

07:26.750 --> 07:27.800
without you,

07:28.190 --> 07:29.480
I would never have had the courage

07:29.480 --> 07:31.480
to speak out all that was in my heart,

07:32.430 --> 07:33.560
nor the wisdom

07:33.950 --> 07:36.070
to understand where my true heart lies.

07:36.070 --> 07:36.870
There would never have been

07:36.870 --> 07:38.159
the Xingxian of today.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.240
Your great kindness,

07:40.630 --> 07:42.960
your faithful devotee will never forget.

07:50.240 --> 07:51.960
This is a small token of my appreciation.

07:51.960 --> 07:53.770
I hope you won't refuse it, sir.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.190
I can't accept it.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.360
Please accept it.

07:57.480 --> 07:58.409
All these years,

07:58.510 --> 08:00.080
if it weren't for Mr. Bai's support,

08:00.080 --> 08:01.210
my Liushui Pavilion

08:01.230 --> 08:03.160
wouldn't have the reputation it has today.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.190
Just consider this small token of appreciation

08:04.190 --> 08:04.950
as some

08:04.950 --> 08:06.610
extra money for your journey.

08:06.950 --> 08:07.830
I hope, sir,

08:08.310 --> 08:09.440
you won't refuse it.

08:16.160 --> 08:18.260
Although I'm just an ordinary person,

08:18.260 --> 08:20.270
I can still tell that your Qin playing is excellent.

08:20.270 --> 08:22.310
As you travel the world in the future,

08:22.310 --> 08:23.270
more people

08:23.310 --> 08:24.510
will hear your music.

08:24.730 --> 08:26.000
I'm happy for you,

08:26.310 --> 08:27.240
and for those people as well.

08:27.240 --> 08:28.070
I hope he dies.

08:29.250 --> 08:30.880
The reason he's still alive

08:31.600 --> 08:33.400
is because I saved him, isn't it?

08:35.780 --> 08:36.470
Mr. Bai.

08:42.120 --> 08:43.049
You must be busy.

08:43.570 --> 08:45.250
I won't take up more of your time.

08:45.250 --> 08:45.850
Well then,

08:45.900 --> 08:47.430
I'll use tea instead of wine

08:47.590 --> 08:49.360
to wish you all the best

08:49.820 --> 08:50.940
and a safe journey.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.760
Then, let's bid farewell here.

08:54.030 --> 08:55.490
Your faithful devotee, Xingxian,

08:55.490 --> 08:57.370
once made three wishes here.

08:57.840 --> 08:59.750
Now they have all come true.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.600
I shouldn't be greedy anymore.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.200
But now,

09:05.790 --> 09:07.510
I have one last wish.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.000
However, this time,

09:12.470 --> 09:13.870
I won't ask for your help.

09:15.490 --> 09:17.350
Please forgive me, Bodhisattva.

09:18.490 --> 09:19.370
This time,

09:21.000 --> 09:22.140
I'll do it myself.

09:43.440 --> 09:44.270
Sir,

09:52.480 --> 09:53.960
why are you here?

09:54.200 --> 09:55.660
I've been waiting for you.

10:01.900 --> 10:03.270
Don't you like the apricot blossom wine

10:03.270 --> 10:05.700
from that tavern at the foot of the mountain?

10:05.700 --> 10:07.100
I specially bought some.

10:08.000 --> 10:08.600
Oh, right,

10:08.910 --> 10:10.770
there's also some marinated duck.

10:10.770 --> 10:13.630
It'll be perfect to go with the wine when we get back.

10:14.320 --> 10:14.850
Let's go.

10:26.150 --> 10:26.890
Sir,

10:27.190 --> 10:28.590
the dishes are all ready.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.580
It looks so sumptuous.

10:32.220 --> 10:33.620
We're leaving tomorrow,

10:33.690 --> 10:35.550
so let's have a good meal tonight.

10:40.000 --> 10:40.480
Come,

10:40.500 --> 10:41.030
try this.

10:41.910 --> 10:43.150
I heard this is a cooking method

10:43.150 --> 10:44.720
that originated from Jiangnan.

10:44.720 --> 10:45.630
The duck meat is tender,

10:45.630 --> 10:47.290
and even the bones are crispy.

10:54.030 --> 10:54.670
Not bad.

10:57.550 --> 10:58.880
When we get to Jiangnan,

10:59.120 --> 11:01.380
we'll have the even more authentic ones.

11:01.840 --> 11:02.370
Alright.

11:03.270 --> 11:05.270
When I said goodbye to Shopkeeper Song today,

11:05.270 --> 11:06.050
he mentioned

11:06.070 --> 11:07.930
several Qin masters in Jiangnan,

11:08.000 --> 11:10.000
and even drafted a few visiting cards for me.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.330
When we reach Jiangnan,

11:12.270 --> 11:14.600
let's visit and learn from them together.

11:16.070 --> 11:18.070
Your Qin playing has a unique style.

11:18.370 --> 11:19.830
It's clear and melodious,

11:20.240 --> 11:21.570
gentle but not cloying.

11:21.910 --> 11:22.870
I really like it.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.880
I don't think I've asked before,

11:27.910 --> 11:30.390
who did you learn to play the Qin from?

11:35.020 --> 11:36.090
It was my mother.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.400
She was originally a Qin master.

11:42.790 --> 11:45.520
Although she was making a living in the marketplace,

11:45.520 --> 11:47.250
she was quite well-known

11:47.890 --> 11:49.090
and respected.

11:50.200 --> 11:50.910
Later,

11:52.360 --> 11:54.240
she fell in love at first sight

11:54.270 --> 11:55.670
with my merchant father.

11:55.720 --> 11:57.390
Two years after their marriage,

11:57.390 --> 11:58.390
I came into being.

11:59.080 --> 12:01.810
Unfortunately, the good times didn't last long.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.690
When I was six years old,

12:04.150 --> 12:05.810
my father's business failed.

12:06.200 --> 12:06.840
He then took out his frustration

12:06.840 --> 12:08.390
on my mother.

12:09.110 --> 12:11.090
He constantly berated her for her humble origins,

12:11.090 --> 12:13.150
saying she couldn't help the family.

12:13.300 --> 12:14.570
As time went on,

12:15.310 --> 12:17.240
my mother stopped playing the Qin.

12:18.410 --> 12:19.290
Eventually,

12:20.270 --> 12:21.870
my younger brother was born.

12:23.030 --> 12:24.320
My mother seemed to believe

12:24.320 --> 12:26.120
that my brother was a lucky star.

12:27.150 --> 12:28.080
She thought that

12:29.360 --> 12:30.530
the family's fortune got better

12:30.530 --> 12:31.990
all because of my brother.

12:32.600 --> 12:34.320
So she joined my father

12:34.630 --> 12:35.630
in belittling me,

12:36.630 --> 12:39.030
and forbade me from touching the Qin again.

12:41.440 --> 12:42.840
But you know what?

12:45.880 --> 12:48.240
I really wanted to play the Qin again.

12:50.790 --> 12:51.590
Don't cry.

12:52.930 --> 12:53.720
You'll definitely be able to

12:53.720 --> 12:55.520
play the Qin again in the future.

12:57.790 --> 12:58.510
I will.

13:01.350 --> 13:03.550
Heaven has given me this wretched life,

13:04.320 --> 13:06.250
not so I could wallow in self-pity.

13:07.480 --> 13:09.120
I will do what I want to do,

13:09.840 --> 13:11.500
and play the Qin I want to play.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.510
Sir.

13:33.120 --> 13:33.750
Sir,

13:34.720 --> 13:36.120
why aren't you drinking?

13:39.120 --> 13:40.650
WIth the moonlight weeping

13:41.360 --> 13:42.420
I shall play a tune.

13:45.370 --> 13:46.770
Would you like to listen?

13:49.390 --> 13:50.030
Alright.

13:56.140 --> 13:59.860
♪ The sun rises, shining bright ♪

14:00.670 --> 14:04.580
♪ Its brilliance blazing ♪

14:05.250 --> 14:08.730
♪ By chance, I glimpse my loved one ♪

14:09.370 --> 14:13.280
♪ Reflected in my eyes ♪

14:14.240 --> 14:17.990
♪ The moon ascends, glowing white ♪

14:19.400 --> 14:23.000
♪ Its glow serene and clear ♪

14:24.100 --> 14:27.990
♪ Again, I glimpse her ♪

14:28.960 --> 14:32.890
♪ Reflected in my eyes ♪

14:38.320 --> 14:39.720
I told you before

14:40.650 --> 14:42.250
that this was a lost old tune.

14:43.330 --> 14:44.660
Actually, I lied to you.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.270
This piece

14:47.610 --> 14:49.010
was composed by me,

14:50.360 --> 14:51.820
written for an old friend.

14:52.400 --> 14:54.730
♫Torturous lovesickness♫

14:54.050 --> 14:55.170
I caught a glimpse of my loved one,

14:54.750 --> 14:58.230
♫Yet mutual confession is even harder♫

14:55.850 --> 14:57.380
and my heart leaps with joy.

14:57.600 --> 14:59.150
She haunts my soul and dreams,

14:59.150 --> 15:00.270
and lingers in my thoughts ever since.

14:59.170 --> 15:05.140
♫Drifting like a willow in the wind, yearning for a good ending♫

15:01.670 --> 15:03.200
Because my heart is bound,

15:04.120 --> 15:05.910
no matter the storm or gale,

15:05.570 --> 15:11.230
♫Side by side, we share a gaze too deep for words♫

15:06.480 --> 15:07.880
harsh frost or cold snow,

15:08.510 --> 15:10.120
I just want to see her once,

15:10.960 --> 15:12.630
even if it's just a glimpse from afar.

15:11.370 --> 15:17.990
♫Keep silent with no regrets♫

15:14.790 --> 15:17.150
Although I have to endure countless hardships,

15:17.150 --> 15:18.480
I'll never tire of it.

15:18.150 --> 15:24.520
♫Share days and nights with you♫

15:24.050 --> 15:24.880
Xingxian.

15:24.810 --> 15:30.950
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

15:27.150 --> 15:27.910
Are you glad

15:29.240 --> 15:30.200
to have known me?

15:31.170 --> 15:34.460
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

15:34.680 --> 15:37.500
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

15:37.520 --> 15:43.870
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

15:42.140 --> 15:43.140
I'm happy too.

15:44.630 --> 15:51.010
♫Share days and nights with you♫

15:51.300 --> 15:57.440
♫In exchange for a lifelong deep love♫

15:57.660 --> 16:00.950
♫Entwined through the endless night♫

16:01.170 --> 16:03.990
♫Blossoms fell into eternal sleep in a blink♫

16:04.010 --> 16:10.360
♫With no regrets, only joy in this life♫

16:15.270 --> 16:16.390
When did I get this?

16:16.410 --> 16:18.010
Why haven't I worn it before?

16:19.270 --> 16:20.200
My Lady,

16:21.080 --> 16:23.010
you still have the mood to dress up?

16:24.260 --> 16:25.780
At a time like this?

16:26.480 --> 16:27.150
The engagement withdrawal

16:27.150 --> 16:28.510
is still up in the air,

16:28.670 --> 16:30.330
and you're not worried at all?

16:31.080 --> 16:32.340
Then what do you think?

16:33.680 --> 16:36.170
If it were up to me,

16:37.600 --> 16:38.870
I would urge the master

16:38.870 --> 16:41.200
to break off the engagement immediately.

16:41.860 --> 16:43.200
I've already spoken clearly

16:43.200 --> 16:45.110
with Li Xian and Father about this matter.

16:45.110 --> 16:46.440
He's still not taking any action.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.480
What else can I do?

16:49.720 --> 16:50.320
My Lady.

16:51.390 --> 16:53.050
Why don't you just tell Master

16:54.100 --> 16:56.290
that you and Physician Jiu are in love

16:56.310 --> 16:57.710
and have sealed the deal.

16:58.480 --> 16:59.870
What nonsense are you talking about?

16:59.870 --> 17:00.870
At worst, Physician Jiu

17:00.870 --> 17:01.930
will get a beating.

17:02.280 --> 17:03.140
After all, he's

17:03.140 --> 17:05.180
our Duan family's saviour.

17:05.480 --> 17:08.079
The master can't beat him too severely, right?

17:08.349 --> 17:09.450
Besides, Physician Jiu

17:09.450 --> 17:10.780
knows martial arts.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.450
A little physical pain,

17:12.480 --> 17:13.680
he can surely endure.

17:15.589 --> 17:17.319
What on earth are you thinking?

17:20.480 --> 17:21.160
Uncle.

17:22.109 --> 17:22.880
Uncle Duan.

17:29.540 --> 17:29.990
Xian.

17:30.720 --> 17:31.520
Have some tea.

17:41.590 --> 17:42.110
Xian,

17:42.590 --> 17:43.650
what are you doing?

17:43.790 --> 17:44.830
Get up and speak.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.690
I have failed you both, uncle and aunt.

17:49.690 --> 17:50.890
I have failed Banxia.

17:51.130 --> 17:52.660
I am too ashamed to stand up.

17:55.720 --> 17:56.440
Good child,

17:56.830 --> 17:58.160
what exactly happened?

17:58.830 --> 17:59.430
Recently,

17:59.720 --> 18:00.750
I've been unable to sleep at night,

18:00.750 --> 18:01.950
tossing and turning.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.550
But after careful consideration,

18:03.550 --> 18:04.510
I still want to express

18:04.510 --> 18:05.570
what's in my heart.

18:06.510 --> 18:07.070
Uncle.

18:08.070 --> 18:08.640
Aunt.

18:09.960 --> 18:12.560
I want to break off the engagement with Banxia.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.640
My family has been in business for three generations,

18:21.640 --> 18:22.720
and they've built this successful enterprise

18:22.720 --> 18:23.550
with much hard work.

18:23.550 --> 18:25.020
to support my education and career.

18:25.020 --> 18:26.150
I indeed carry many expectations

18:26.150 --> 18:27.080
on my shoulders.

18:27.930 --> 18:29.680
Hence, in the future, I plan to devote my energy

18:29.680 --> 18:31.010
to my political career,

18:31.170 --> 18:32.210
to work diligently as an official,

18:32.210 --> 18:33.670
and make a name for myself.

18:33.790 --> 18:35.590
As for the matter of marriage...

18:36.440 --> 18:38.000
Banxia is gentle and virtuous,

18:38.000 --> 18:39.360
clever and intelligent.

18:39.360 --> 18:40.180
She will surely find

18:40.180 --> 18:42.440
a husband a hundred times better than me.

18:42.590 --> 18:45.120
I beg you, uncle and aunt, to grant my request.

18:49.270 --> 18:50.680
To become a high-ranking official,

18:50.680 --> 18:52.300
and bring honour to one's ancestors.

18:52.300 --> 18:54.460
There's no man in this world

18:54.510 --> 18:56.240
who wouldn't be moved by such an ambition.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.570
I can understand your grand aspirations.

18:59.130 --> 19:00.260
But your father...

19:02.240 --> 19:02.790
As for my father,

19:02.790 --> 19:05.520
I will explain everything clearly to him myself.

19:06.750 --> 19:07.310
Well,

19:07.640 --> 19:08.700
what about others?

19:09.680 --> 19:11.210
Uncle, please don't worry.

19:11.480 --> 19:12.030
To the outside world,

19:12.030 --> 19:13.110
I will say it's due to my personal reasons

19:13.110 --> 19:14.240
that I cannot marry.

19:14.400 --> 19:15.030
I will not tarnish

19:15.030 --> 19:16.290
Banxia's reputation.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.960
I am wholeheartedly committed to becoming an official

19:22.960 --> 19:24.290
and serving my country.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.810
I sincerely ask for your approval.

19:36.720 --> 19:37.270
Xian,

19:37.310 --> 19:38.240
please stand up.

19:41.480 --> 19:42.210
My dear Xian,

19:42.480 --> 19:43.400
your determination is admirable.

19:43.400 --> 19:45.130
How could I not grant your wish?

19:45.510 --> 19:47.480
If all the men in the world

19:47.480 --> 19:48.550
were like you,

19:48.920 --> 19:51.720
it would truly be a blessing for the common people.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.550
Uncle, you are so understanding.

19:53.550 --> 19:54.880
I am ashamed to face you.

19:55.880 --> 19:56.540
This matter

19:56.550 --> 19:58.310
is due to our lack of consideration.

19:58.310 --> 19:59.270
It has nothing to do with you.

19:59.270 --> 20:00.470
No, no, it's my fault.

20:01.550 --> 20:03.280
It's my lack of consideration.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.880
Although I don't know

20:11.920 --> 20:13.180
what you're thinking,

20:13.750 --> 20:15.440
I still want to thank you.

20:17.270 --> 20:18.930
If you really want to thank me,

20:19.400 --> 20:21.270
you can help me with something.

20:24.000 --> 20:24.590
Xuanye,

20:26.350 --> 20:28.110
please accept my bow.

20:33.000 --> 20:33.790
Since childhood, I have longed for

20:33.790 --> 20:35.350
the art of seeking immortality and enlightenment.

20:35.350 --> 20:36.440
I even shaved my head

20:36.440 --> 20:37.510
to enter a monastery for cultivation.

20:37.510 --> 20:38.640
But unfortunately,

20:38.960 --> 20:40.790
I was still caught and brought back home by my father.

20:40.790 --> 20:41.920
he even deceived me,

20:42.000 --> 20:43.440
saying there were no deities

20:43.440 --> 20:44.350
or demons in this world,

20:44.350 --> 20:46.070
and it was all just to fool children.

20:46.070 --> 20:47.240
But as I grew older,

20:47.930 --> 20:50.200
I gradually began to think it was all false.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.350
So I gradually gave up on the idea

20:51.350 --> 20:52.880
and focused on my political career.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.740
Until that day,

20:54.030 --> 20:54.960
I saw you.

20:55.550 --> 20:56.160
Master.

20:57.190 --> 20:59.270
You fought the willow spirit in the stone forest.

20:59.270 --> 20:59.790
With just one move,

20:59.790 --> 21:01.070
you made it reveal its true form.

21:01.070 --> 21:02.310
I saw it clearly.

21:02.890 --> 21:04.080
Then you reasoned with it,

21:04.080 --> 21:04.960
appealed to its emotions,

21:04.960 --> 21:05.870
and with just a few words,

21:05.870 --> 21:07.480
you made it willingly leave Guangping

21:07.480 --> 21:08.780
and avoided a conflict.

21:08.780 --> 21:09.910
From that moment on,

21:09.920 --> 21:11.160
the raging fire in my heart

21:11.160 --> 21:12.220
was ignited by you.

21:12.400 --> 21:12.880
I knew

21:12.880 --> 21:14.350
that was what I had been seeking all my life.

21:14.350 --> 21:15.510
I must follow you.

21:16.160 --> 21:18.620
Please, Master, accept me as your disciple.

21:20.960 --> 21:21.480
Wait.

21:25.160 --> 21:26.020
Master's wife,

21:29.720 --> 21:31.070
things are not going well on my end.

21:31.070 --> 21:33.330
Could you please put in a good word for me?

21:35.680 --> 21:36.540
Master's wife.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.580
Master's wife.

21:40.310 --> 21:41.170
Master's wife?

21:42.110 --> 21:42.640
Indeed.

21:42.970 --> 21:44.210
Master may not know.

21:44.510 --> 21:45.740
I just went to the Duan family

21:45.740 --> 21:47.510
and called off this absurd marriage.

21:47.510 --> 21:48.370
From now on,

21:48.400 --> 21:50.200
the master's wife and I will go our separate ways,

21:50.200 --> 21:51.590
and have nothing to do with each other.

21:51.590 --> 21:51.980
Of course,

21:51.980 --> 21:53.160
I truly didn't know before

21:53.160 --> 21:54.790
that you two have such a relationship.

21:54.790 --> 21:56.090
Otherwise, even if I had ten times the courage,

21:56.090 --> 21:57.000
I wouldn't dare to do

21:57.000 --> 21:58.600
such a disrespectful thing.

21:59.220 --> 22:01.350
Fortunately, I came to my senses in time.

22:01.350 --> 22:02.750
Otherwise, I might have

22:03.680 --> 22:05.530
severed this bond with you, Master.

22:05.530 --> 22:06.960
Please accept me as your disciple.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.240
Wait, wait, wait.

22:11.000 --> 22:12.400
The main issue is that my knowledge is limited.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.400
I really can't teach you.

22:13.400 --> 22:14.200
Master,

22:14.400 --> 22:15.750
please don't make excuses.

22:15.750 --> 22:16.310
Your skills,

22:16.310 --> 22:17.920
I saw them clearly that day.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.000
Of course, I understand.

22:19.000 --> 22:19.920
A master like you

22:19.920 --> 22:21.680
might be reluctant to take on disciples.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.200
But Master, I'm different.

22:23.200 --> 22:23.830
Today,

22:24.110 --> 22:26.400
I've come with a do-or-die determination.

22:26.400 --> 22:28.000
I must, absolutely must, follow you.

22:28.000 --> 22:29.060
If you don't agree,

22:30.310 --> 22:31.310
I'll kneel until I die

22:31.310 --> 22:32.970
outside this Ganshan Clinic.

22:33.400 --> 22:33.960
Hold on.

22:35.510 --> 22:37.310
Don't you hold an official position?

22:37.310 --> 22:39.770
How can you focus on spiritual cultivation?

22:39.880 --> 22:41.410
Are you worried about this?

22:41.640 --> 22:42.790
Please don't worry, Master.

22:42.790 --> 22:44.310
I will inform my parents tomorrow

22:44.310 --> 22:46.240
that I'll resign from my position.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.480
Oh, right.

22:48.760 --> 22:50.790
Weren't you aiming to become a high-ranking minister?

22:50.790 --> 22:52.030
That was merely rhetoric

22:52.030 --> 22:53.000
to deceive Uncle.

22:53.000 --> 22:53.480
Master,

22:53.900 --> 22:55.700
please don't take it seriously.

22:56.200 --> 22:56.920
Moreover,

22:57.480 --> 22:58.550
I truly find this official position

22:58.550 --> 23:00.080
completely unsatisfying.

23:01.270 --> 23:02.870
My ambitions lie elsewhere.

23:04.110 --> 23:04.840
I've decided

23:05.200 --> 23:06.930
to follow you for life, Master.

23:07.830 --> 23:10.290
Do you have any other requirements, Master?

23:13.270 --> 23:14.130
Master's wife.

23:14.820 --> 23:15.680
Master's wife.

23:15.680 --> 23:16.540
That's enough.

23:17.750 --> 23:18.480
Xuanye,

23:19.670 --> 23:21.710
why don't you

23:21.960 --> 23:23.920
consider him?

23:35.310 --> 23:36.040
Pour the tea.

23:40.880 --> 23:42.480
Offer the tea to your master.

23:43.400 --> 23:44.460
Thank you, Master.

23:47.270 --> 23:48.300
[Ganshan Clinic]

23:52.030 --> 23:52.510
Master.

23:53.350 --> 23:54.210
Master's wife,

23:54.510 --> 23:56.310
I will set off for home tomorrow.

23:56.610 --> 23:57.370
I wonder if you two elders

23:57.370 --> 23:58.500
would be available

23:58.520 --> 23:59.480
to see me off?

23:59.720 --> 24:00.920
"You two elders"?

24:00.920 --> 24:01.450
Alright,

24:01.550 --> 24:02.610
it's getting late.

24:02.880 --> 24:04.480
Go pack your things quickly.

24:04.700 --> 24:06.030
I take my leave, Master.

24:07.520 --> 24:07.930
Wait,

24:07.960 --> 24:10.360
you're really taking him as your disciple?

24:11.510 --> 24:12.270
What else?

24:12.950 --> 24:14.060
Should I let you, the master's wife,

24:14.060 --> 24:15.120
marry him instead?

24:18.030 --> 24:18.960
What did you say?

24:19.640 --> 24:20.680
Master's wife?

24:26.290 --> 24:26.900
It's me.

24:28.160 --> 24:34.550
[Jude Restaurant]

24:32.020 --> 24:33.720
I have been staying in Guangping

24:33.720 --> 24:34.850
for over a month now.

24:35.610 --> 24:36.950
My parents have written to me several times,

24:36.950 --> 24:38.160
urging me to return home.

24:38.160 --> 24:39.960
I really can't delay any longer.

24:40.640 --> 24:41.160
Master,

24:41.480 --> 24:42.540
once I return home,

24:42.620 --> 24:43.340
meet my parents,

24:43.340 --> 24:44.270
and resign from my official position,

24:44.270 --> 24:46.600
I'll immediately come back to follow you.

24:46.880 --> 24:48.160
There's no need to rush like that.

24:48.160 --> 24:50.480
You can spend more time with your parents at home.

24:50.480 --> 24:51.410
How can I do that?

24:51.510 --> 24:52.960
Of course, learning the art comes first.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.590
Since I've already taken you as my master,

24:54.590 --> 24:56.310
it's only natural that I follow you

24:56.310 --> 24:57.970
and focus on learning, right?

24:59.130 --> 25:00.160
You've really taken on

25:00.160 --> 25:02.090
a studious disciple, haven't you?

25:04.400 --> 25:05.200
Young master,

25:05.720 --> 25:06.850
it's time to depart.

25:07.070 --> 25:07.600
Alright.

25:07.880 --> 25:08.480
Well then.

25:08.920 --> 25:09.480
Master.

25:10.350 --> 25:11.210
Master's wife.

25:12.110 --> 25:13.170
I bid you farewell.

25:16.200 --> 25:16.830
Li Xian,

25:19.310 --> 25:20.000
thank you.

25:32.370 --> 25:35.030
His father won't allow him to resign from his position.

25:35.030 --> 25:35.920
I guess he won't be able

25:35.920 --> 25:37.030
to come back anytime soon.

25:37.030 --> 25:38.830
You don't need to worry anymore.

25:39.270 --> 25:39.870
Everyone,

25:40.180 --> 25:40.910
please wait.

25:41.070 --> 25:42.350
Take care, Lord Gu.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.640
Take care, Lord Gu.

25:54.030 --> 25:55.100
Is there something

25:55.750 --> 25:57.010
I can help you two with?

25:58.880 --> 25:59.880
Where's Chilian?

26:01.960 --> 26:02.680
You...

26:03.960 --> 26:04.960
You already know?

26:08.030 --> 26:09.630
Well, since that's the case,

26:09.790 --> 26:11.520
I won't hide the truth from you.

26:11.790 --> 26:13.590
Actually, my husband, Zhang Pu,

26:13.800 --> 26:15.020
is not as bad as

26:15.040 --> 26:16.170
the neighbours say.

26:17.310 --> 26:19.170
Our relationship was very close.

26:19.710 --> 26:21.660
My husband treated me very well,

26:22.250 --> 26:23.580
but he loved to drink.

26:24.070 --> 26:25.400
He often drank too much.

26:25.790 --> 26:26.920
When he gets drunk,

26:27.240 --> 26:29.640
he would inevitably become a bit irritable.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.680
But you know,

26:31.000 --> 26:32.400
aren't all men like that?

26:32.750 --> 26:34.700
But that damn snake demon Chilian,

26:35.030 --> 26:36.230
he took a liking to me.

26:36.750 --> 26:37.490
When I refused him,

26:37.490 --> 26:38.770
he killed my husband,

26:39.700 --> 26:40.890
and even forcibly abducted me

26:40.890 --> 26:43.420
to transform me into his current appearance,

26:44.350 --> 26:45.480
forcing me to stay by his side

26:45.480 --> 26:46.480
as his substitute.

26:46.480 --> 26:47.240
You can

26:47.260 --> 26:48.230
testify to this.

26:48.960 --> 26:50.350
The last time you came to visit,

26:50.350 --> 26:51.790
the person you saw was me.

26:52.720 --> 26:53.270
I was also

26:53.270 --> 26:54.880
forced to deceive you

26:55.510 --> 26:57.570
under his threats and intimidation.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.680
You mean,

27:01.070 --> 27:03.130
all of this was forced upon you by him?

27:04.510 --> 27:05.160
Yes.

27:06.510 --> 27:08.840
Your husband treated you well, didn't he?

27:09.110 --> 27:09.680
Yes.

27:10.640 --> 27:11.880
My poor husband.

27:15.070 --> 27:16.730
So where is Chilian now?

27:20.550 --> 27:21.440
Dead.

27:23.830 --> 27:25.960
He kept forcing me to do things for him.

27:26.160 --> 27:28.000
I couldn't bear the humiliation anymore,

27:28.000 --> 27:30.330
and wanted to avenge my husband even more.

27:30.670 --> 27:32.370
So I asked a snake catcher,

27:32.400 --> 27:33.700
used the method he gave me

27:33.700 --> 27:35.460
and fed Chi Lian realgar wine.

27:36.310 --> 27:37.670
After he drank the medicinal wine,

27:37.670 --> 27:39.530
he indeed revealed his true form.

27:40.020 --> 27:41.020
I was very scared,

27:41.270 --> 27:42.640
but I knew I couldn't back down.

27:42.640 --> 27:44.640
Otherwise, I would be the one dying.

27:45.160 --> 27:47.310
I took advantage of the moment when the wine took effect,

27:47.310 --> 27:49.570
and stabbed his vital point with a knife,

27:50.490 --> 27:51.380
killing him.

27:56.590 --> 27:57.830
Now his body

27:58.750 --> 27:59.480
is inside that box

27:59.480 --> 28:00.590
in the courtyard.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.640
As you two can see,

28:06.240 --> 28:08.680
I have become like this now.

28:09.070 --> 28:11.110
Although I have already killed my enemy with my own hands,

28:11.110 --> 28:11.920
my life

28:12.160 --> 28:13.890
can never go back to what it was.

28:14.420 --> 28:15.820
So I'm leaving Guangping

28:16.090 --> 28:17.880
to start a new life.

28:18.960 --> 28:19.960
Thank you both.

28:20.410 --> 28:23.230
Although I was still no match for the cunning demon,

28:23.230 --> 28:24.440
your kindness

28:24.780 --> 28:26.970
will be remembered by Xingxian.

28:28.110 --> 28:30.040
Lord Gu must be getting impatient.

28:30.420 --> 28:31.620
Let's part ways here.

28:43.690 --> 28:44.990
It seems that the snake catcher

28:44.990 --> 28:45.910
Xingxian found

28:46.090 --> 28:47.690
knows some snake-catching techniques,

28:47.690 --> 28:49.750
but doesn't know how to catch demons.

28:50.590 --> 28:52.070
Chilian has practiced asceticism for many years,

28:52.070 --> 28:53.830
and has also devoted himself to studying Buddhism.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.660
There's no trace of demon aura left on him.

28:55.660 --> 28:57.660
Ordinary methods won't work on him.

28:57.830 --> 28:59.490
Even if realgar is used on him,

28:59.640 --> 29:00.640
it won't be fatal.

29:01.040 --> 29:02.270
So does that mean he's not dead?

29:02.270 --> 29:04.270
He's deceiving Xingxian, isn't he?

29:05.070 --> 29:05.920
I suppose so.

29:06.390 --> 29:11.520
[Blossoms by Day, Moonlight by Dusk]

29:07.240 --> 29:09.370
Then why does he want to fake his death?

29:09.610 --> 29:11.210
To take revenge on Xingxian?

29:12.400 --> 29:13.860
If he wanted revenge,

29:14.270 --> 29:16.000
why would he go to such lengths?

29:18.640 --> 29:21.510
He probably wants to put Xingxian's mind at ease.

29:24.550 --> 29:26.200
He wants Xingxian to believe

29:26.640 --> 29:29.100
that Chilian no longer exists in this world,

29:29.640 --> 29:32.030
that there's no longer a person called Mr. Bai.

29:32.030 --> 29:32.590
This way,

29:32.840 --> 29:33.590
Xingxian can

29:33.590 --> 29:34.990
take over this identity,

29:35.200 --> 29:37.060
and have this life all to herself.

29:37.080 --> 29:38.680
She can do whatever she wants,

29:38.680 --> 29:40.340
and live the life she desires.

29:41.510 --> 29:42.550
It's just a pity,

29:43.640 --> 29:45.440
a pity for Chilian's Qin skills.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.350
From now on,

29:48.210 --> 29:50.070
he might never play the Qin again.

29:50.710 --> 29:52.370
He's been so good to Xingxian,

29:52.510 --> 29:54.170
yet this is how it ends for him.

29:54.400 --> 29:55.160
I guess

29:55.510 --> 29:56.590
Xingxian must have

29:56.590 --> 29:58.030
helped Chilian in the past.

29:58.030 --> 29:58.950
So all of this

29:59.240 --> 30:00.640
is likely of his own will.

30:01.650 --> 30:03.370
But this is so unfair.

30:04.110 --> 30:04.920
Regardless,

30:05.600 --> 30:07.730
Chilian did commit murders after all.

30:08.030 --> 30:09.490
To have this outcome today

30:09.920 --> 30:11.520
is considered not bad at all.

30:16.740 --> 30:18.590
The bonds of grudges and grievances unravelled

30:18.590 --> 30:20.510
and the shackles of obsession broken free.

30:20.510 --> 30:21.110
Perhaps,

30:21.650 --> 30:23.380
he has already left Guangping.

30:25.480 --> 30:26.790
In this vast world of mortals,

30:26.790 --> 30:28.650
with boundless skies and waters,

30:28.680 --> 30:29.740
he will surely find

30:30.180 --> 30:31.980
someone who truly cares for him.

31:05.350 --> 31:06.210
It's you again.

31:07.310 --> 31:09.110
Although I was lucky to survive,

31:09.350 --> 31:10.920
I still suffered severe injuries.

31:10.920 --> 31:11.680
Years of cultivation

31:11.680 --> 31:13.440
have been destroyed in an instant.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.720
I no longer possess such strong magical powers

31:14.720 --> 31:16.050
to protect you anymore.

31:16.510 --> 31:18.240
Why are you still following me?

31:22.470 --> 31:23.530
You're very angry?

31:26.230 --> 31:27.960
What's there to be angry about?

31:32.460 --> 31:33.400
That demon hunter

31:33.400 --> 31:34.530
was actually right.

31:35.200 --> 31:36.530
I fought evil with evil,

31:36.590 --> 31:38.320
and committed acts of killing.

31:38.480 --> 31:40.810
Naturally, I must face the consequences.

31:43.110 --> 31:43.750
In fact, heaven

31:43.750 --> 31:45.150
has not been unkind to me.

31:45.830 --> 31:47.430
At least I'm still alive now,

31:48.190 --> 31:49.650
allowing me to start anew.

31:54.110 --> 31:54.750
Alright,

31:55.240 --> 31:56.330
stop following me.

33:02.560 --> 33:04.290
You're busted, Commissioner.

33:05.220 --> 33:06.120
I've been feeling

33:06.120 --> 33:07.580
something was off lately.

33:07.720 --> 33:09.320
You were faking it after all.

33:09.880 --> 33:10.270
I...

33:11.030 --> 33:12.000
I just woke up.

33:13.070 --> 33:13.720
I'm dizzy.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.800
Alright, stop pretending.

33:16.290 --> 33:16.960
The smell of your braised duck

33:16.960 --> 33:18.690
has spread all over the street.

33:19.590 --> 33:20.790
Where did you hide it?

33:22.110 --> 33:22.680
Really?

33:23.530 --> 33:24.930
I didn't smell anything.

33:25.950 --> 33:27.480
Don't say you didn't eat it.

33:28.030 --> 33:28.890
I didn't eat it.

33:29.110 --> 33:29.920
The chicken leg from yesterday,

33:29.920 --> 33:30.400
the ribs from the day before,

33:30.400 --> 33:32.640
and the braised pork hock from three days ago.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.970
Were they eaten by a dog?

33:35.000 --> 33:35.920
Dog?

33:38.830 --> 33:39.310
Right.

33:39.510 --> 33:40.350
I ate them.

33:40.350 --> 33:40.880
So what?

33:41.030 --> 33:41.750
I'm a patient.

33:41.750 --> 33:42.640
Shouldn't I eat a bit more

33:42.640 --> 33:43.440
to nourish myself?

33:43.440 --> 33:44.000
Besides,

33:44.110 --> 33:44.830
look at the kind of food

33:44.830 --> 33:46.060
you feed me every day.

33:46.310 --> 33:47.110
Thin porridge for breakfast,

33:47.110 --> 33:47.880
thin porridge for lunch,

33:47.880 --> 33:49.470
and still thin porridge for dinner.

33:49.470 --> 33:50.600
You're a patient.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.750
Patients can only have liquid food.

33:52.750 --> 33:53.480
Moreover,

33:53.960 --> 33:55.310
didn't I give you pickles?

33:55.310 --> 33:56.240
Two kinds, even.

33:56.350 --> 33:56.790
Right.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.310
I almost forgot if you didn't mention it.

33:58.310 --> 33:59.360
Those pickles of yours,

33:59.360 --> 34:00.550
they're so salty they could kill a dog.

34:00.550 --> 34:02.750
Is this even fit for human consumption?

34:03.590 --> 34:04.450
Sima Lingying,

34:04.970 --> 34:05.920
eat it or not, it's up to you.

34:05.920 --> 34:07.450
No one's forcing you to eat.

34:07.680 --> 34:08.960
I'm taking care of you out of kindness,

34:08.960 --> 34:10.150
and now I'm the one at fault?

34:10.150 --> 34:11.000
Don't think I don't know

34:11.000 --> 34:12.260
what you're thinking.

34:12.480 --> 34:13.610
You want to stay here

34:13.880 --> 34:15.080
and make me marry you.

34:15.400 --> 34:16.730
I'm telling you, no way.

34:17.250 --> 34:18.909
I already have someone I like.

34:21.650 --> 34:22.310
Who?

34:23.230 --> 34:24.670
It couldn't be

34:25.550 --> 34:26.550
Banxia, could it?

34:29.340 --> 34:29.860
Yes,

34:30.969 --> 34:31.940
it is Banxia.

34:32.400 --> 34:33.860
I'm not afraid to tell you.

34:34.270 --> 34:35.270
In the null,

34:35.290 --> 34:36.190
I am the county commandant

34:36.190 --> 34:37.710
and she is my bride-to-be.

34:37.889 --> 34:39.730
We are in love

34:40.000 --> 34:42.330
and have pledged ourselves to each other.

34:43.070 --> 34:43.760
In the null?

34:44.550 --> 34:46.350
Why don't you say in your dreams?

34:48.929 --> 34:50.670
The null... The null may be fake,

34:50.670 --> 34:51.870
but the feelings are real.

34:51.870 --> 34:53.469
Fine, the feelings are real.

34:53.630 --> 34:54.590
Have you asked Banxia?

34:54.590 --> 34:55.659
Does she feel the same way?

34:55.659 --> 34:56.710
There's no need to ask.

34:56.710 --> 34:57.960
She's in my heart,

34:58.150 --> 35:00.500
so naturally, I'm in hers too.

35:01.400 --> 35:02.100
Youhuang.

35:03.320 --> 35:03.920
Youhuang.

35:04.230 --> 35:04.760
Sima.

35:06.400 --> 35:07.200
You're awake?

35:07.920 --> 35:08.480
Indeed.

35:08.510 --> 35:09.630
It's time to wake up.

35:09.630 --> 35:10.800
You sure have perseverance.

35:10.800 --> 35:11.800
You laid here for so long,

35:11.800 --> 35:13.130
you even gained weight.

35:14.660 --> 35:15.220
I have

35:15.240 --> 35:16.440
some good news for you two.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.970
Xuanye is getting married.

35:21.800 --> 35:22.480
Then,

35:22.840 --> 35:24.000
who's the bride?

35:24.670 --> 35:25.760
Who else could it be?

35:25.760 --> 35:27.090
It's Banxia, of course.

35:29.320 --> 35:29.710
Ban-

35:30.030 --> 35:30.710
Banxia.

35:34.190 --> 35:37.320
You've been exposed, haven't you, Chief Constable Chu?

35:37.360 --> 35:38.960
What's wrong? What's wrong?

35:42.230 --> 35:43.290
Have some pickles.

35:57.010 --> 35:58.340
No, I don't understand.

35:58.440 --> 36:00.070
Why did you tell Wen Jian and the others

36:00.070 --> 36:01.630
that we're getting engaged?

36:01.630 --> 36:03.690
You haven't even asked me about this.

36:04.920 --> 36:06.320
I went to see your father.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.880
He was the one who set the date.

36:07.880 --> 36:09.740
But you didn't discuss it with me.

36:11.110 --> 36:12.070
You don't agree?

36:16.000 --> 36:17.090
Why are you angry?

36:22.780 --> 36:23.910
Why are you upset?

36:25.760 --> 36:27.160
Why are you sitting here?

36:29.590 --> 36:31.230
What's wrong with me sitting here?

36:31.230 --> 36:32.430
This isn't your seat.

36:33.800 --> 36:35.710
Well, we're getting married,

36:35.970 --> 36:37.400
Forget about your seat,

36:37.590 --> 36:38.990
this whole house is mine.

36:40.210 --> 36:41.510
Your name isn't carved here.

36:41.510 --> 36:43.310
How can you prove it's all yours?

36:44.030 --> 36:45.560
You want names carved, huh?

36:45.800 --> 36:46.190
Fine.

36:47.840 --> 36:48.900
Let's carve names.

36:56.000 --> 36:56.800
Xuanye,

36:57.350 --> 36:58.680
do something about her.

36:59.590 --> 37:00.630
I actually think

37:00.960 --> 37:01.940
it's carved quite nicely.

37:01.940 --> 37:02.980
[Banxia]

37:21.660 --> 37:22.990
Don't be angry anymore.

37:23.680 --> 37:24.630
You can't make decisions

37:24.630 --> 37:26.290
on your own like this anymore.

37:27.330 --> 37:28.000
I just wanted to

37:28.000 --> 37:29.930
get your father's approval first.

37:30.020 --> 37:30.960
I didn't expect that the old man

37:30.960 --> 37:32.620
is so decisive and efficient.

37:32.670 --> 37:33.550
The very next day, he have found someone

37:33.550 --> 37:35.010
to set an auspicious date.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.400
You know well, that

37:36.670 --> 37:39.230
your father used to work as an official in the government

37:39.230 --> 37:41.430
and is good friends with Clerk Yang Lin.

37:41.440 --> 37:43.300
He was the one who told Clerk Yang,

37:43.480 --> 37:44.880
who then told Wen Jian.

37:45.220 --> 37:46.750
Wen Jian then came to ask me,

37:47.050 --> 37:48.110
so what could I say?

37:48.920 --> 37:49.540
Well, you could at least

37:49.540 --> 37:51.740
discuss it with me first, couldn't you?

37:52.630 --> 37:53.590
I thought we had

37:53.590 --> 37:55.320
already agreed on this before.

37:55.670 --> 37:56.110
You...

37:56.110 --> 37:56.800
Alright.

37:58.250 --> 37:59.250
It's all my fault.

37:59.880 --> 38:01.080
Even if we had agreed,

38:01.550 --> 38:03.110
I should have formally

38:03.110 --> 38:04.040
asked you again.

38:05.920 --> 38:06.550
Banxia,

38:07.350 --> 38:09.110
we've known each other for so long.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.550
You know me well.

38:11.180 --> 38:13.180
I'm merely a fighter.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.050
Both my parents died

38:15.360 --> 38:17.020
and my brother is gone as well.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.740
I have no accomplishments

38:18.920 --> 38:20.150
nor talent.

38:21.280 --> 38:23.340
I just look after this medicine shop,

38:23.510 --> 38:25.520
catching demons and monsters every day.

38:25.520 --> 38:27.180
Life isn't easy for me either.

38:31.000 --> 38:31.590
But I can

38:31.620 --> 38:32.910
swear with my life.

38:34.000 --> 38:35.660
if you are willing to marry me,

38:36.050 --> 38:37.680
I will treat you sincerely

38:38.030 --> 38:39.290
for the rest of my life,

38:40.190 --> 38:41.230
do my utmost

38:41.670 --> 38:43.330
to make you happy and content.

38:45.030 --> 38:47.260
No matter what dangers may come in the future,

38:47.260 --> 38:48.590
I will fight with my life

38:49.030 --> 38:50.560
to protect you completely.

38:55.280 --> 38:56.000
So,

38:56.660 --> 38:58.260
are you willing to believe me

38:58.840 --> 39:00.070
and marry me?

39:03.000 --> 39:04.800
Why do you make it sound so scary?

39:07.860 --> 39:09.060
Will you or won't you?

39:11.800 --> 39:13.000
Let me think about it.

39:15.510 --> 39:17.110
How long do you need to think?

39:18.760 --> 39:20.160
I just started thinking.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.150
It's okay.

39:25.860 --> 39:27.120
I can wait a bit longer.

39:27.320 --> 39:28.980
Take your time to consider it.

39:33.630 --> 39:34.830
Is three days enough?

39:37.630 --> 39:38.760
Dream on.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.400
Are you hoping that

39:40.400 --> 39:41.050
while I'm considering,

39:41.050 --> 39:42.450
you can change your mind?

39:44.280 --> 39:45.280
I've agreed to it.

39:48.800 --> 39:49.440
What?

39:51.670 --> 39:52.760
I said I've agreed.

39:53.970 --> 39:54.830
I'll marry you.

39:55.350 --> 39:58.600
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

39:56.800 --> 39:59.110
You've tried to snatch me as a bride so many times,

39:59.110 --> 40:00.480
who else could I marry if not you?

39:59.230 --> 40:02.390
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

40:03.030 --> 40:06.540
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

40:06.620 --> 40:10.160
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

40:10.690 --> 40:14.070
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

40:14.480 --> 40:17.410
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

40:17.670 --> 40:20.000
♫I miss you♫

40:20.230 --> 40:22.110
♫On every moonlit night♫

40:22.200 --> 40:26.490
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

40:26.030 --> 40:26.760
Xuanye.

40:27.740 --> 40:31.490
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

40:29.590 --> 40:30.400
Xuanye.

40:31.740 --> 40:34.990
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

40:35.560 --> 40:37.440
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

40:37.460 --> 40:39.190
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

40:39.330 --> 40:42.800
♫And mostly because I met you♫

40:43.280 --> 40:46.750
♫When life gets hard♫

40:47.230 --> 40:50.310
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

40:50.850 --> 40:52.700
♫This lingering love♫

40:52.730 --> 40:54.730
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

40:54.750 --> 40:57.440
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

40:57.540 --> 41:00.190
♫Right by my side♫

41:07.710 --> 41:08.770
What are you doing?

41:08.940 --> 41:10.540
It took you so long to come up.

41:11.030 --> 41:11.830
Wait a moment.

41:16.190 --> 41:17.730
My father bought these dates from the East Market.

41:17.730 --> 41:19.390
They're very sweet. Try some.

41:22.670 --> 41:23.800
How did you get up here?

41:23.800 --> 41:24.800
Is there a ladder?

41:25.030 --> 41:25.630
No,

41:27.800 --> 41:29.000
there are two stools.

41:29.070 --> 41:30.400
Tingzhou is holding them steady.

41:30.400 --> 41:31.590
My Lady, please come down quickly.

41:31.590 --> 41:32.520
It's dangerous.

41:34.150 --> 41:35.360
Be careful.

41:36.360 --> 41:37.200
It's very safe.

41:37.070 --> 41:40.440
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

41:39.320 --> 41:39.880
Are you hungry?

41:39.880 --> 41:41.440
Do you want to go out and eat something?

41:40.710 --> 41:43.940
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

41:43.610 --> 41:44.690
It's already this late.

41:44.460 --> 41:48.010
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

41:44.840 --> 41:46.440
It won't digest if we eat now.

41:48.070 --> 41:48.670
That's true.

41:48.310 --> 41:51.440
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

41:49.590 --> 41:50.630
I promised Zhizhi

41:50.630 --> 41:52.080
we'd lose weight together.

41:52.080 --> 41:55.500
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

41:52.360 --> 41:53.510
Otherwise, at the wedding,

41:53.510 --> 41:54.570
we won't look good.

41:55.780 --> 41:58.760
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

41:57.400 --> 41:58.660
What do you want to eat?

41:58.760 --> 41:59.800
I'll go with you tomorrow.

41:59.100 --> 42:01.510
♫I miss you♫

42:01.280 --> 42:03.280
I want to have that sweet soup.

42:01.660 --> 42:03.270
♫On every moonlit night♫

42:03.550 --> 42:08.020
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

42:05.400 --> 42:06.710
If we go out,

42:07.510 --> 42:08.550
we should also visit

42:08.550 --> 42:09.510
that tailor shop.

42:09.120 --> 42:12.910
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

42:09.880 --> 42:11.400
My new dress is ready.

42:12.710 --> 42:13.190
Alright.

42:13.110 --> 42:16.450
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

42:13.400 --> 42:15.060
I'll accompany you tomorrow.

42:16.980 --> 42:18.900
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

42:18.480 --> 42:19.030
Banxia,

42:18.930 --> 42:20.710
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

42:19.670 --> 42:21.110
I have something to gift you.

42:20.730 --> 42:23.990
♫And mostly because I met you♫

42:22.760 --> 42:23.290
This one.

42:24.550 --> 42:28.080
♫When life gets hard♫

42:26.190 --> 42:26.960
What is this?

42:28.030 --> 42:29.300
This is something my mother gave me.

42:28.440 --> 42:31.720
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

42:30.360 --> 42:31.620
I'll give it to you now.

42:32.290 --> 42:34.170
♫This lingering love♫

42:32.590 --> 42:33.270
Banxia.

42:34.190 --> 42:36.100
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

42:35.070 --> 42:35.710
My Lady.

42:36.120 --> 42:38.800
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

42:36.150 --> 42:37.350
My father, my father!

42:37.760 --> 42:38.980
Be careful, be careful!

42:38.980 --> 42:41.470
♫Right by my side♫
